dialogue cathedral_party_talk
title: The organ
trigger: ThemeStart cathedral
speaker commander $commander
speaker trusted $trusted
speaker enchantress - name=Enchantress portrait=whitewitch

node a commander
  That music is coming from the walls. I know this sound. We sang the Manalith to sleep with it.
  -> b

node b enchantress
  Your Lullaby. The Choir built the organ around it. The runaway says every hold's tithe ends in those pipes, and the Hierarch drinks the skim. The Lullaby needs a little. He takes the rest. Let's make it stop.
  * Before we go in. You've got something to say. -> speak
    if: TrustAtLeast $trusted 25
  * We stop it. Today.

node speak trusted
  Only this. Whatever you sang in that room long ago, you walked us here to end it. I go in beside you.
  * Beside me, then. The first pipe we break, we break together. -> together
    do: AddTrust $trusted 6
  * Stay close in there. I'll need someone who knows my voice. -> voice
    do: AddTrust $trusted 4

node together trusted
  Together. I'll be listening for it.

node voice trusted
  I know it. I'd know it through a whole choir.
